  "content": "The experience I wish to share is one in which my father passed over and I witnessed him leaving. I saw a little whirlwind leave the top of his head as it fell into my arm. Then I saw my mother extend her hand and I heard her laugh. I do remember thinking, 'Science is trying to measure what I saw.' Do you wonder what you look like when you leave your body? This is my answer to what you look like at death. I wonder if that little gray whirlwind leaves if you are coming back. Does it leave and then return? During a NDE, does the golden shimmering light lift from the body and return? If this is information not useful to you, I apologize for the inconvenience.",
